  "title": "Paper 3 COVID Sub-Period Sharpe 1.295 vs 1.254 \u2014 Canonical Replication",
  "description": "Reproduces the COVID sub-period Sharpe ratios cited in Paper 3 main.tex: Sharpe 1.295 (TSMOM-hedged VT) vs 1.254 (unhedged VT) for 50/50 SPY/GLD. Tests multiple COVID period definitions against paper claim.",
